"the GLM-5.2 8-node A2 guide. It starts one process per local DP rank and\n"
"propagates child failures. Prefill does not use this launcher (its\n"
"`--nnodes 4` is handled by `vllm serve` directly)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This reference invokes the launcher with the A2 topology (see the\n"
"commands in Section 5.4.4): `--dp-size 16 --tp-size 2 --dp-size-local 4`,\n"
"`--dp-rank-start` 0/4/8/12 per node, DP RPC port 12990 on\n"
"`<DECODE_NODE0_IP>`, and API ports 10010-10013."
msgstr ""

